│                           │ ── The keys to know first ──                                                                                                     ┃
│                           │   •  Ctrl+N: open a new HTTP request.                                                                                            ┃
│                           │   •  Ctrl+Enter: send the request.                                                                                               ┃
│                           │   •  Ctrl+W x: stop the request that runs.                                                                                       │
│                           │   •  Ctrl+S: save the request to a file.                                                                                         │
│                           │   •  Ctrl+P: open the command palette. Type a part of an action name, or ":" and a command.                                      │
│                           │   •  F4: choose the environment.                                                                                                 │
│                           │   •  Ctrl+W ,: open the settings.                                                                                                │
│                           │   •  Ctrl+W q: quit Sendito.                                                                                                     │
